        "description": "Respiratory distress in neonatal period",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of micrognathia, hyperphalangy of the index finger, and cleft palate",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is clinical and supported by radiographic findings of hyperphalangy."
